hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27904","Yunus ibn Muhammad narrated to us, he said: Layth ibn Sad narrated to us, he said: Yazid ibn Abi Habib narrated to me, from Bukayr ibn Abd Allah, from al-Mundhir ibn al-Mughirah, from Urwah ibn al-Zubayr, that Fatimah bint Abi Hubaysh narrated to him that she came to the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, and complained to him of bleeding, so the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: That is a vein, so watch: when your menstruation comes to you, do not pray, and when the period passes, purify yourself, then pray between one period and the next."
